        "created_at": "2015-11-16T15:41:32.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>According to <a href=\"http://handelabra.com/blog/2015/11/13/mini-pack-2-is-coming\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">the blog post</a>, beginning with the Mini-Pack 2 update, \"...there will now be a simple button to allow fast unlocking of variants 30 days after initial release. This should preserve the mad rush to figure out the story challenges for that first month, while keeping things kosher as far as Apple is concerned.\"</p><p>Question: If you use the button to unlock a variant, would you still be notified when you do whatever would have unlocked it without the button?</p><p>I know there's been some talk about in-game achievements, so I was wondering how those might play together.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:45:47.280Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
